{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "bb4003f8ea095a0f8ae2d46c15164473bdcae77ed872a0b71f95ef70f66ee298", "ja": "フワフワ☆超特訓", "zh": "轻飘飘☆超级特训", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "96d1820ec0e88fcc19cbc44964df232cb0ce51bc8dbda8e94ec75dfeaad953e8", "ja": "仲間に隠れ、ひとり遅くまで残ってレッスン\nを続けるジュリア。真剣な様子に、まつりは\nレッスンの手伝いを申し出る。エターナル\nハーモニーとしてのライブを成功させたい\nのは、ジュリアだけではない、と語る。", "zh": "茱莉亚瞒着其他团员，独自训练到很晚。\n见到她如此认真，茉莉便提出想帮忙训练。\n茉莉表示，\n想让『Eternal Harmony』的演唱会成功的，\n并非只有茱莉亚一个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "052874045c047d53a2f93326209652a7a4c628d7b555ff7fc7591963b43edd77", "ja": "（エターナルハーモニーのレッスン開始から、数日。\nエミリーもジュリアも、相変わらず苦戦している……）", "zh": "（自从『Eternal Harmony』开始训练后已过了几天。\n艾蜜莉和茱莉亚两人，仍然在苦战当中……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "be0131bc5d05721ddb36d99f4679fef9069db8ccfb88df6877989d2697f92b00", "ja": "しまった、もうこんな時間か……。レッスンの様子を\n見に行こうと思ったが、みんな帰ってるだろうな。", "zh": "糟糕，都这么晚了……本来还想去看大家训练得如何，\n这下她们应该已经回去了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "76b1c8af1e0e99a780dd008f9840776118930cb9b00bc59d47d06cfd33a6419e", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nはいほー！なのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\nHi Ho的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0ff2d02a3f68abcf88a13b0cf9a9cf3cdbd139f060c09f398edf45d33ecf442b", "ja": "まつり？　まだ残ってたのか。\nレッスンはもう、とっくに終わったんじゃないのか？", "zh": "茉莉？你还没回去啊？\n训练不是早就结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "d51f7560bf5b0a734b877f6d67b5b2292f6fd739fe0a6d4da1be430e2b84598c", "ja": "それなのです。\n終わったけど、終わっていないのです。", "zh": "这就是重点的喔。\n训练结束了，但还没结束的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b8727deceb43e6bd1a4e7bf51d7cfd4b7e3d520ddb3b12cec978a66b6b3a56e9", "ja": "つまり……どういうことだ？", "zh": "意思是……怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "aa2021ff15bc5bc74131996dbb90eda6472626b98400ecee26d00216a123dd05", "ja": "つまり、ジュリアちゃんが\nひとりで居残りレッスンをしているのです。", "zh": "意思就是说，\n小茱莉亚独自留下来训练的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9ccc4fcc8eb14d95ab6c5743f1452535df8ed498e227f91c6287fe1b94453bf0", "ja": "ジュリアが、ひとりで居残りを？　それは心配だな……\n教えてくれてありがとう、まつり。", "zh": "茱莉亚独自留下来训练？\n真让人担心……茉莉，谢谢你告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "4e3914eb2cce4f2bcfb0251484349849523972bf0e6a6f805bf945a2078f08c9", "ja": "礼には及ばない、なのですよ。\nそれより、姫もついていくのです。", "zh": "不用道谢的喔。\n倒是公主也要一起跟去的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "c14e87368a75e02862fb9ce9c85465721c2a1fe020529909fd1916916870f19c", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー、\nファイブ、シックス……", "zh": "1、2、3、4、5、6……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "8952914a39065efaab5189fd71c9e500f44e7a534378aaff7edd6d48382c6fd4", "ja": "うわっ！？", "zh": "哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "0a1715469923785567fc3fb30d3548f6f809fd517129ba6ac6a375ae80186b3b", "ja": "くぅ……やっぱダメか。\nまた同じところで転んじまった……。", "zh": "呜……还是不行吗？\n又在同一个地方跌倒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a4ef36eb8970f39874324aedbf7dfba2548da04147d3a58d9d1042dc018633da", "ja": "それは疲れてるせいじゃないのか？　ジュリア。", "zh": "茱莉亚，那是因为你累了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "eba18faca089123175b9b445934ac223b0fd33da3bc329e5a412ff22f5271921", "ja": "そうですよ、ジュリアちゃん。\n無理をしてはダメなのです。", "zh": "就是说啊，小茱莉亚。\n不可以太勉强自己的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "03f9b1fef9fa2bc61b9e5dd5380c26d599847a44eb51a8d9e245170b32f0027f", "ja": "{$P$}、マツ……。", "zh": "{$P$}、阿茉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "a7178eb28b64b01b2cf3c108280de969c91e756f83964e4a2aaa30340c181c45", "ja": "……いや。\nいくらあんたでも、こればかりは譲れない。", "zh": "……不行。\n就算是你，这点我也不能退让。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "28d891da14a5bde203234ecc9d5eedf9471e87451f8425e7e8f3f04646cc42ea", "ja": "チハはそれぞれのペースでいいって言ってたが、\nこのままじゃ本番に間に合わない。", "zh": "虽然千说按照各自的步调来就好，\n但再这样下去就赶不上正式表演了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "15a87a5ae42c770305d2d77b92d03640f226237ba6d23288219d188e6f98b63a", "ja": "あたしひとりが足を引っ張ったせいで、\nエターナルハーモニーのライブをダメにしたくない。", "zh": "我不想因为我一个人扯后腿，\n搞砸了『Eternal Harmony』的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "98b7e3ed3432d5db0d632484b60babd3f79a0e6ed9f704205a78209306e4ca4d", "ja": "ジュリア……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "57ea0919f161ee5ddbc0aa7d2d78430ab74224b53f8f6f7c0654967266d8b1a2", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん。ジュリアちゃんは、\nどうしてそんなに頑張るのです？", "zh": "小茱莉亚。\n为什么小茱莉亚要那样努力的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "76b5908ecdd56ad5a5859d9b618c56724ee02a359df96da6d1cc926dff19221b", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんは、本当はアイドルではなく、\nロック歌手になりたかったのではないのですか？", "zh": "小茱莉亚本来并不是想当偶像，\n而是想当摇滚歌手，难道不对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c558aa3ee676c88ce88b12d153d5b1d66a5cd0d6a01a730fc503cecf69380514", "ja": "まつり……。", "zh": "茉莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "a5327eb3ad9f358ad27850c72f741857cfc83c4e9d80b1d7d80119e9edac1015", "ja": "……ああ。そのとおりだよ、マツ。\nあたしは別に、ロックを諦めたわけじゃないからな。", "zh": "……对，阿茉你说得没错。\n我并不是放弃了摇滚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "b97e688e23691a7361c8b9c4e8ee24a26f95210b5a6761242e9272e77b4cca9a", "ja": "でも今の、765プロライブ劇場にいるあたしは、\nアイドルだ。歌って踊るのが、あたしの仕事だ。", "zh": "不过如今身在765艺能演唱会剧场的我，是一名偶像。\n唱歌跳舞，这些才是我的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "6222e9ce6dd72e7707e679552896ba496940fcf94159fb6304558827b1dd6deb", "ja": "ハンパにアイドルやってると思われたくないんだ。\nそれじゃ、アイドルにもロックにも失礼だろ？", "zh": "我不想被认为是抱着玩乐的心情在当偶像，\n那样不是对偶像和摇滚都很失礼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "c00518a2933837c6fa6a69578407b0611046291ef8b6e62a70e8f76be4d18efe", "ja": "だから、やれるところまでやりたい。どれも\n中途半端で、不完全燃焼ってのだけは、絶対にイヤだ。", "zh": "所以我才想尽自己所能去努力。\n我绝不要两边都当半吊子，再来后悔没有全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "04f3c0acc2bca2f89077a4a676f2b7d94bdeb4dcb8560d7d7e3b7cff4ad61535", "ja": "……ジュリアちゃんは、頑張り屋さんなのですね。", "zh": "……小茱莉亚真的非常勤奋的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "99396f5848822f192c83b55963c963667ec735727b9bfcc14b84da9fa9a13544", "ja": "わかったのです。それでは今回は、\n特別にまつりが協力してあげるのです！", "zh": "茉莉明白了喔。\n那么这次，茉莉会特别协助你的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ab8701843905cf9ce7e705c79709f630e0c35cffc2d2ce3c05d318e1622ca42", "ja": "え？　協力って……。", "zh": "咦？你说协助是指……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "583272f77f9552cdb8d99111ae17fd9fb0f3bfb7b08540b0dfdace240b74c2dc", "ja": "まつり、ありがとう。\nけど、何をする気だ？", "zh": "茉莉，谢谢你。\n但你打算做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "064ce21df485aa8ab181aab433b278b43645bb2169e2db66dd418c68c12978be", "ja": "{$P$}さん、姫におまかせなのです。\n姫がジュリアちゃんに、魔法をかけてあげるのです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，交给公主的喔。\n公主要对小茱莉亚施魔法了唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "d193d41cc5beca72c5ad68d4193cdd2a65ff5d555b9d66c50d2edbb135492ff1", "ja": "ただし、まつりの魔法はちょっぴり厳しいのです。\nフワフワに、最後までついてくるのです！", "zh": "不过，茉莉的魔法有一点严格的说。\n它会轻飘飘地跟着你，直到最后一刻的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "4dc9ecb8c9235d349a28828b531a6efa965f7e822e6dc51f44b8d312495baa75", "ja": "……ね？　ジュリアちゃん。……ね？", "zh": "……呐？小茱莉亚……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf3e2917676e65b94a49548f3bacb8e64726f9a8486df4f2394f54e68f118c4b", "ja": "え、ち、ちょっと待て……怖い！\n笑顔が怖い、マツ！　こ、こっち来るなあ～！？", "zh": "咦，你、你等一下……好可怕！\n阿茉你的笑容好可怕！别、别过来啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "806173d398cb5d21591e45537204c05a0b285b850d60a4246f8476ce9ee7c9e9", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん、覚悟！なのですー！！", "zh": "小茱莉亚，要做好心理准备喔～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "b3a5ff76c91e6d25bae0ec82e4e4bb1f0da1caf6a24ea81934c1066b277973f9", "ja": "うわあああーーー！！？", "zh": "哇啊啊啊───！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3193e929c6fdc559c957f6d90fbf4440217d4dcb1656b8d36f2a8972a9c763cd", "ja": "（その後、まつりコーチによる、\n世にも恐ろしいフワフワ超特訓が始まった……）", "zh": "（于是在那之后，在茉莉教练的带领下，\n展开了极端恐怖的轻飘飘超级特训……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "d45053b20a0e6421e8c5e6b389d2edd1ffc73510b2a21271ef89aab59b2ff79b", "ja": "全然違うのです！　そこは蝶のように、\nぱたぱたと華麗に踊るのです！", "zh": "完全不对的说！\n那边要像蝴蝶一样，翩然华丽起舞的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "1b2f107e80ec2add7a386b1151ceb0c382ac0e51f681996ea8a395ec4a8bee08", "ja": "い、意味がわからない……！\nえっと、こうか？　それとも……？", "zh": "听、听不懂你在说什么……！\n呃，是这样吗？还是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "dc2246a5fe0ff9dd6037fa84103d408aa6997514d38b2b1e209eaa03bc57adec", "ja": "そこは、蜂のように鋭くなのです！\nもっとぱわほー！に、素早く舞うのです！", "zh": "那边要像蜜蜂一样犀利的唷！\n要舞动得更强大又敏捷的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "3dfd9f4d88b6ea8331e4f081fcae5e5893d369e8ef78581de11f8d4ab44338d1", "ja": "これ以上、速く動けって！？　……くぅ～！\nやってやるぜ！　見てろよ、マツ！！", "zh": "叫我还要更快！？……呜～！\n我就跟你拚了！看好了，阿茉！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1041_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "ddbb66a20b7d643e3ec8e0c9c80d5f52439a055cc835273400e0219f9ab8e390", "ja": "ぜー、はー、ぜー、はー……。\nし、死ぬかと思った…………。", "zh": "呼……呼……呼……呼……\n我、我还以为我要挂了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1043_021mat", "source_sha256": "bdeca3a1dad266519e78b4e4d7e7184c26d15d05133924757819248f8cf45646", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんは、大げさなのです。\nダンスで人は死なないのですよ？", "zh": "小茱莉亚你太夸张了喔。\n跳舞死不了人的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "ed0bfb002288a0430e3b87c2cf73ae580a86783cf01592ef90fe9818266631fe", "ja": "いや、俺もちょっと思ったけどな……。\nというか、意外とスパルタなんだな、まつり……。", "zh": "不，我刚才也有点怀疑她会……\n话说，没想到茉莉这么斯巴达呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "0553765fb82d529caabc6fef06b11dcd64ec38b828a014a6c9e4d79676200126", "ja": "ほ？　なんのことなのです？\nまつりはただの、かよわい姫なのです。", "zh": "哦？你在说什么的呢？\n茉莉从头到脚，都只是个娇弱的公主的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1046_021mat", "source_sha256": "d1f14e8b37aa9ef1414057e245044338d1207fa83818ecd3715487e53a6e7395", "ja": "姫の魔法で、ジュリアちゃんの願い事を\n叶えてあげただけなのです♪", "zh": "公主只是施了魔法，\n实现小茱莉亚的愿望呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "97280d5055bcb95f2f625190332e4d69756fbbee888b67d72f48670fc8bdaf2a", "ja": "魔法にしては、力づくって感じもしたが……何にせよ、\nステップができるようになってよかったな、ジュリア。", "zh": "要说这是魔法，好像有点太靠蛮力了……\n总之，你能学会舞步真是太好了，茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "1cf6fb667720d092d6c5fbf1fda568a92ab0a48bf2360a9330e3b9b8ed66c0ef", "ja": "あ、ああ……。なんか、喜ぶよりも疲れのほうが\nすごくて、まだ実感がわかないけど……。", "zh": "对、对啊……只是比起喜悦，我更觉得累到不行，\n所以还没什么真实感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1049_050jul", "source_sha256": "8ee8404ce729d1ffbfacb935f3869f61f3c4cda9adad353c8ae65c1cc3089916", "ja": "あたしの練習に付き合ってくれてサンキュ、マツ。\n……それじゃ、着替えてくるか！", "zh": "阿茉，谢谢你陪我练习。\n……那我去换衣服了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "de24b51816b41bdef7079762c0f68eec1f834ee667d47b24fca282240cc1251d", "ja": "まつり、いろいろありがとうな。\n俺からも礼を言わせてくれ。", "zh": "茉莉，谢谢你做了这么多。\n我也要向你道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1051_021mat", "source_sha256": "6cdd1846e6b60b02c96da2f47f65016246079916eb847b0871033c4dd2663ce2", "ja": "……エターナルハーモニーのライブを成功させたいのは\nジュリアちゃんだけじゃないのです。", "zh": "……想让『Eternal Harmony』的演唱会成功的人，\n并不只有小茱莉亚的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1052_021mat", "source_sha256": "a61b7755bdf9922c4e78e65dacb0e6f5494c580d3fca6f6d8e1066f5298a8c5a", "ja": "だから、これはまつりのためでもあるのですよ。\n……ね？", "zh": "所以说，这么做也是为了茉莉自己的唷。\n……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1053_p", "source_sha256": "bf31773540f3301708bfa680eeca468885ac75952a7efd13408236d7c6a3b5f1", "ja": "うん……そうだな。\nエターナルハーモニーのライブ、成功させような。", "zh": "嗯……你说得对。\n我们要让『Eternal Harmony』的演唱会成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1054_021mat", "source_sha256": "a9ee112d6a56ee8dcadd868b1f3a0a9a56cba6374f5b887e55cf92e6bf42248f", "ja": "当然なのです♪", "zh": "那是当然的呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0033_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_04_1055_p", "source_sha256": "81b7b154bb62481b86cb7eec58eff41175129d4ec2163b0447b4ada8b32ee572", "ja": "（ジュリア、それにまつり。成功を願う気持ちの強さが\nユニットを強くする。他のみんなも、きっと……！）", "zh": "（茱莉亚，还有茉莉。她们强烈渴望成功的心，\n能让团体变得更强。其他人肯定也一样……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
